menu "Gateway: Modbus TCP gateway"

    config GW_MBTCP_MAX_CLIENTS
        int "Simultaneous Modbus TCP clients"
        range 1 4
        default 2
        help
            Further connections are closed at once. Requests of every client are served one
            at a time, like everything else on the RS485 bus.

    config GW_MBTCP_TASK_PRIORITY
        int "Modbus TCP server task priority"
        range 1 10
        default 3

    config GW_MBTCP_RESPONSE_WAIT_MS
        int "Longest wait for the bus owner to run a forwarded request (ms)"
        range 500 12000
        default 8000
        help
            The request waits for the transaction in progress and the pending DCMD writes.
            If the bus owner has not run it in this time the client gets exception 0x0B
            (gateway target device failed to respond).

endmenu
